ssue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n* Reproducible on 4.5.1.stable and 4.5.0.stable\n* Didn't check but wasn't an issue on 4.4.0.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 Pro\n\n### Issue description\n\nDepending on `Camera2D` zoom, the display of the `PopupMenu` changes.\n\nWith 1x zoom:\n<img width=\"1161\" height=\"657\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ebfefe1-d535-4402-b845-34c9902bac31\" />\n\nWith 2x zoom:\n<img width=\"1159\" height=\"654\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba271227-56e7-414c-81f1-57fc458d810e\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Create a 2D scene with root `Node2D` and two children `PopupMenu` and `Camera2D`.\n* Add one or more items to the `PopMenu`.\n* Add the following script to the root `Node2D`:\n```\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _unhandled_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tif not event is InputEventKey: return\n\tif not event.is_pressed(): return\n\tmatch (event as InputEventKey).keycode:\n\t\tKEY_P: ($PopupMenu as PopupMenu).popup_centered()\n\t\tKEY_I: ($Camera2D as Camera2D).zoom = Vector2(2, 2)\n\t\tKEY_O: ($Camera2D as Camera2D).zoom = Vector2(1, 1)\n```\n* Run the scene.\n* Press `P` on the keyboard (when the popup is hidden) after pressing `I` (for zoom in) and `O` (for zoom out).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-popup-menu-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23152262/test-popup-menu-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url